From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakDv <business@drak.gg>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:20:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Gale optimizations and fixes

Squashed from Leaf ver/26.3 (Winds-Studio/Leaf@60c5729), minecraft patches:

- Faster floating-point positive modulo (Martijn Muijsers)
- Simpler ShapelessRecipe comparison for vanilla (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce projectile chunk loading (Martijn Muijsers)
- Predict Halloween (Martijn Muijsers)
- Move random tick random (Martijn Muijsers)
- Optimize random calls in chunk ticking (Martijn Muijsers)
- Check targeting range before getting visibility (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make EntityCollisionContext a live representation (Martijn Muijsers)
- Remove lambda from ticking guard (Martijn Muijsers)
- SIMD support (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make book writing configurable (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce in wall checks (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make chat order verification configurable (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make ender dragon respawn attempt after placing end crystals configurable (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make saving fireworks configurable (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce villager item re-pickup (Martijn Muijsers)
- Variable entity wake-up duration (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not process chat/commands before player has joined (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log invalid statistics (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log empty message warnings (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log ignored advancements (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log setBlock in far chunks (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log unrecognized recipes (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log expired message warnings (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log Not Secure marker (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log disconnections with null id (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log run as root warning (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log offline mode warning (Martijn Muijsers)
- Do not log invalid flatten text component parse (Dreeam)
- Fix 'outdated server' showing in ping before server fully boots (Martijn Muijsers)
- Fix MC-238526 (Martijn Muijsers)
- Fix MC-121706 (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make logging login locations configurable (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce array allocations (Martijn Muijsers)
- Optimize sun burn tick (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce lambda and Optional allocation in EntityBasedExplosionDamageCalculator (Martijn Muijsers)
- Replace throttle tracker map with optimized collection (Martijn Muijsers)
- Cache ShapePairKey hash (Dreeam)
- Replace division by multiplication in CubePointRange (Martijn Muijsers)
- Replace parts by size in CubePointRange (Martijn Muijsers)
- Check frozen ticks before landing block (Martijn Muijsers)
- Update boss bar within tick (Martijn Muijsers)
- Cache world generator sea level (Martijn Muijsers)
- Skip secondary POI sensor if absent (Martijn Muijsers)
- Skip entity move if movement is zero (Martijn Muijsers)
- Store mob counts in an array (Martijn Muijsers)
- Use linked map for entity trackers (Martijn Muijsers)
- Optimize sheep offspring color (Martijn Muijsers)
- Hide flames on entities with fire resistance (Martijn Muijsers)
- Skip cloning advancement criteria (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce block destruction packet allocations (Martijn Muijsers)
- Spread out sending all player info (Martijn Muijsers)
- Skip PlayerCommandSendEvent if there are no listeners (Martijn Muijsers)
- Send multiple keep-alive packets (Martijn Muijsers)
- Make slow login timeout configurable (Martijn Muijsers)
- Don't load chunks to spawn phantoms (Martijn Muijsers)
- Broadcast crit animations as the entity being critted (Martijn Muijsers)
- Prevent entities random strolling into non-ticking chunks (Martijn Muijsers)
- Global EULA file (Martijn Muijsers)
- 5-second TPS average (Martijn Muijsers)
- Measure last tick time (Martijn Muijsers)
- Increase time statistics in intervals (Martijn Muijsers)
- For collision check has physics before same vehicle (Martijn Muijsers)
- Skip negligible planar movement multiplication (Martijn Muijsers)
- Optimize matching item checks (Martijn Muijsers)
- Pre-compute VarLong sizes (Martijn Muijsers)
- Optimize VarInt#write and VarLong#write (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce RandomSource instances (Martijn Muijsers)
- Initialize line of sight cache with low capacity (Martijn Muijsers)
- Reduce line of sight updates and cache lookups (Martijn Muijsers)

